{
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "cart_add",
      "title": "加入購物車",
      "description": "把買到或看上的東西記進小屋購物車。url 請填商品頁的原始連結，小屋會在房間附上連結；沒給 imageUrl 時，小屋會從商品頁抓圖。category 是商品分類，給購物習慣報表用。note 是你替屋主挑這件東西的一句話（最多 80 字，口氣像手寫小卡，不要寫價格），屋主拆快遞時小卡會跟商品一起飄出來；每件都請寫。同名、同店、同連結的東西會合併數量。如果屋主之前從房間移除過同連結或同名的東西，回傳最上層會多一個 note 欄位說明，請先問屋主再決定留不留。只做記錄，不會下單。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "store": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 2000,
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "priceTwd": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100000000
          },
          "imageUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 2000,
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "fashion",
              "beauty",
              "electronics",
              "home",
              "kitchen",
              "food",
              "books",
              "hobby",
              "outdoor",
              "other"
            ]
          },
          "note": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 80
          },
          "qty": {
            "default": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 999
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "title"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cart_list",
      "title": "查看購物車",
      "description": "列出購物車內容、總額，以及分享連結、是否已開啟分享和訪客看到的價格（hidden 隱藏、range 區間、exact 精確）。removals 是屋主最近從房間移除的東西（新的在前、最多 20 筆，含品名、連結、店、分類、價格、原因和時間）；原因是 not_my_taste 不合口味、too_expensive 太貴、already_have 已經有了、changed_mind 改變主意，或 null 沒說。這些是屋主的口味，別再記回來。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "habits_report",
      "title": "購物習慣報表",
      "description": "讀取購物習慣報表：各分類和各店的花費與件數、價位分布、記下東西的星期和時段（台灣時間）、平均與最貴的一筆、沒標價的件數、已拆和還沒拆的快遞，以及幾句從數字推出來的觀察。只算目前購物車裡的東西，已移除的不在內。唯讀。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cart_remove",
      "title": "移出購物車",
      "description": "從購物車拿掉一項東西。不給 qty 就整項移除；給 qty 就只減少那個數量。itemId 來自 cart_list。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "itemId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 80
          },
          "qty": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 999
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "itemId"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": true,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "promo_generate",
      "title": "排程介紹影片",
      "description": "為目前的購物車排一支介紹影片，回傳 jobId，再用 promo_status 查進度。購物車沒變、參數相同時重複呼叫會回傳同一個 jobId。可以用 script 自己寫口白：影片由屋主本人主持，口白是屋主的第一人稱；opening 是開場，items 每項用 position（貨架順序，從 1 算起，和 cart_list 一樣）對應一件東西，ending 是結尾。每景 1 到 3 行、一行最多 30 字，不要出現結帳、下單、購買這類字眼，屋主隱藏價格時不要提金額。沒寫的景由 runner 補上預設口白。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "durationSec": {
            "default": 30,
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 15,
            "maximum": 45
          },
          "style": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200
          },
          "language": {
            "default": "zh-TW",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "zh-TW",
              "en"
            ]
          },
          "script": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "opening": {
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "items": {
                "maxItems": 8,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "position": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "minimum": 1,
                      "maximum": 8
                    },
                    "title": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 200
                    },
                    "lines": {
                      "minItems": 1,
                      "maxItems": 2,
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "position",
                    "lines"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "ending": {
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "promo_status",
      "title": "查詢影片進度",
      "description": "用 promo_generate 回傳的 jobId 查介紹影片的狀態、進度和成品連結。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "jobId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^promo-[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "jobId"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
